sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Desarrollador
    participant Local as Repo Local
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Actions as GitHub Actions
    participant CF as Cloudflare Tunnel
    participant Server as Servidor WSL2
    participant PM2 as PM2
    participant App as Aplicacion

    Note over Dev,App: Flujo Completo de CI/CD

    Dev->>Local: git add . && git commit
    Dev->>Local: git push origin main
    Local->>GH: Push commits

    Note over GH,Actions: Trigger automatico del workflow

    GH->>Actions: Activar workflow deploy.yml
    Actions->>Actions: Iniciar runner Ubuntu

    Note over Actions,CF: Conexion segura via tunnel

    Actions->>CF: Conexion SSH via tunnel
    CF->>Server: Reenviar conexion SSH

    Note over Actions,Server: Comandos de despliegue

    Actions->>Server: cd ~/lecrev/app
    Actions->>Server: git pull origin main
    Server-->>Actions: OK - Codigo actualizado

    Actions->>Server: npm install
    Server-->>Actions: Dependencias instaladas

    Actions->>Server: npm run build
    Server-->>Actions: Build exitoso

    Actions->>Server: pm2 restart lecrev-app
    Server->>PM2: Solicitud de restart
    PM2->>App: Detener proceso viejo
    PM2->>App: Iniciar proceso nuevo
    App-->>PM2: Aplicacion corriendo
    PM2-->>Server: Restart exitoso
    Server-->>Actions: Despliegue completado

    Note over Actions,GH: Reportar resultado

    Actions->>GH: Actualizar status del commit ✓
    GH->>Dev: Notificacion (email/webhook)

    Note over Dev,App: Nueva version en produccion!
